---
Draw wavetable position visualizer in synth editor.

Show the current wavetable waveform at the selected position,
with an indicator showing which frame is active.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Waveform display shows current wavetable frame
- [ ] Position indicator shows location within bank (0..num_frames)
- [ ] Waveform updates when position knob changes
- [ ] During playback, position indicator follows modulation envelope/LFO
- [ ] Works for all 4 bundled wavetable banks

## Test Plan
- [ ] Adjust position knob, verify waveform changes
- [ ] Play note with position envelope, verify indicator moves
- [ ] Switch banks, verify waveform updates
- [ ] Visual: waveform shape matches expected bank content
